      "created_at": "2025-07-18T10:56:17.528Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Stock entry approval are taking too much time.  Sometime it takes more then 5 minutes for approving single stock entry heaving &lt; 10 item details with batch details.  On an average it is between 2 to 3 minutes. It’s horrible if more than 100 transactions have to be approved in a day.  Any suggestion to improve it or usually it consume this time.</p>",
